SUMMARY:They Live
DTSTART:20250814T010000Z
DTEND:20250814T025500Z
DTSTAMP:20250814T010000Z
UID:VUDcsmrY4m
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 94 mins (1h34m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club A rugged loner (R
 oddy Piper) stumbles upon a terrifying discovery: goulish creatures are ma
 squerading as humans while they lull the public into submission through su
 bliminal advertising messages.  Introduced by SIFF Cinema Assistant Manag
 er Tony Ochoa.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/siff-movie-club
 /they-live
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Florida Project
DTSTART:20250904T010000Z
DTEND:20250904T031500Z
DTSTAMP:20250904T010000Z
UID:jORvnGHgO2
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 115 mins (1h55m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club Warm\, winning\,
  and gloriously alive\, Sean Baker’s The Florida Project is a deeply mov
 ing and unforgettably poignant look at childhood.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/
 programs-and-events/siff-movie-club/the-florida-project
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Green Room
DTSTART:20251002T010000Z
DTEND:20251002T025500Z
DTSTAMP:20251002T010000Z
UID:g1OjoVw2NO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 94 mins (1h34m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club Green Room is a b
 rilliantly crafted and wickedly fun horror-thriller starring Patrick Stewa
 rt as a diabolical club owner who squares off against an unsuspecting but 
 resilient young punk band. Introduced by SIFF Cinema Assistant Manager Ton
 y Ochoa.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/siff-movie-club/green
 -room
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
